1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,600
“Your family first? Always?”

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,705
Maa said it to Papa an hour
before the Lakshmi puja.

3
00:00:05,705 --> 00:00:09,704
Seven days of cleaning. Diyas,
rangoli, all ready.

4
00:00:09,704 --> 00:00:10,724
And Papa…

5
00:00:10,724 --> 00:00:12,114
turned up the TV.

6
00:00:12,114 --> 00:00:16,424
Tanvi stood in between, puja thali
in hand. The house is spotless…

7
00:00:16,424 --> 00:00:18,622
but does Lakshmi come
to a home like this?

8
00:00:18,622 --> 00:00:20,616
Chanakya's answer is a surprise.

9
00:00:20,616 --> 00:00:24,356
Chanakya Niti names 3 signs of a home
Lakshmi enters on her own.

10
00:00:24,356 --> 00:00:28,059
One: where fools aren't honoured.
The sensible word wins,

11
00:00:28,059 --> 00:00:29,678
not the loudest voice.

12
00:00:29,678 --> 00:00:34,008
Two: where grain is stored with
care. Saving, not waste.

13
00:00:34,008 --> 00:00:36,500
Three: where husband and wife
don't quarrel.

14
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:39,723
And notice… not one of the three
is about cleaning.

15
00:00:39,723 --> 00:00:42,756
Where fools aren't honoured,
grain is well stored,

16
00:00:42,756 --> 00:00:46,994
and the couple doesn't quarrel,
there Shri comes of her own
accord.

17
00:00:46,994 --> 00:00:49,612
There Lakshmi comes… on her own.

18
00:00:49,612 --> 00:00:52,320
Papa put the remote down
and said: “My mistake.

19
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,540
Shall we light the diya together?”

20
00:00:54,540 --> 00:00:58,401
In your home, what comes first?
Making up before the puja,

21
00:00:58,401 --> 00:01:01,523
or settling scores
after? Comment 1 or 2.

